Ability: Check out an order

  As a shopper
  I want to pay for what is in my cart
  So that the shop sends it to me

  Rule: delivery is free for orders of €50.00 or more

    Example: an order of €75.00
      Given the cart total is €75.00
      When I pay for the order
      Then I am not charged for delivery

  Rule: a paid order is confirmed by email

    Example: card payment accepted
      Given the cart total is €30.00
      When I pay for the order by card
      Then I receive an order confirmation email
